=================================================================================
DESIGNED PROCEDURE
=================================================================================
The arc is OFF -> ON -> (protocol-selective) -> REMOVED, and every leg is graded on the
WIRE, not on a `show` command.  `platforms/x960.md` §5 records this platform reporting a
feature Enabled while the dataplane did nothing, so "Enabled" is not a measurement here.
Each ON leg is paired with a control that must NOT produce the thing (STANDING-ORDERS §7).
Instrument: `tcpdump` on tb277 eth3 filtered to `tcp port 23`, decoded by `tools/tcpflow.py`;
client: `tools/netlogin.py` on the box; corroborating third instrument: the DUT's own
`show log` (`telnetd` connection lines), which is independent of both.

