Designed expectation: a telnet client on the box reaches a login prompt, authenticates, runs
commands and sees their real output; the DUT shows the session as a `vty` line sourced from
the box's address; and the whole exchange is visible as an ESTABLISHED TCP/23 conversation
carrying cleartext payload.

