            flags={ACK, FIN.ACK, PSH.ACK, PSH.ACK.URG, SYN.ACK}

and the cleartext payload the DUT sent, decoded from that same pcap (tcpflow --ascii,
first 900 B of the 1266 B captured; full output in work/t33378-on-ascii.txt):

    ..... ..#..'..............!........awplus login: Password:
    Last login: Mon Oct 19 22:34:43 UTC 2026 on ttyS0
    No entry for terminal type "network";
    using vt100 terminal settings.
    AlliedWare Plus (TM) 0.0.0 10/12/26 06:38:00

    awplus>terminal length 0
    awplus>show users
    Line    User            Host(s)  Idle      Location        Priv Idletime Timeout
    con 0   manager         idle     00:00:43  ttyS0           15   10       N/A
    vty 0   manager         idle     00:00:01  10.38.22.33     1    10       N/A
    awplus>show telnet
